WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.535
-Did you ever realize
that you were gonna be a --

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.736
I mean, you've had
such a great career,

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:06.172
but you make people
have the good cries.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.506
-Yeah.
So, I started with

00:00:07.506 --> 00:00:08.874
"A Walk to Remember"
when I was 16.

00:00:08.874 --> 00:00:10.810
-"A walk to Remember."
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.846
-Thank you.

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:15.515
[ Cheers and applause
continues ]

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.783
-Look at that.
I mean, is that --

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:19.619
-Little baby Mandy.
-I know, baby Mandy.

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:20.619
-Baby Mandy.

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:22.321
-You're still baby Mandy,
please.

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:23.756
But do people come up to you
and go like,

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:25.824
"I love that movie,
and that was how I met..."?

00:00:25.824 --> 00:00:29.328
-That movie has touched people
and still continues to

00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:32.031
in a way that, like,
we never, ever expected.

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:33.600
I'm totally flattered.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.670
I'm slightly flabbergasted that,
like, the sort of things

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.707
in my career that I'm most known
for are making people cry.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.975
-No, but no --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.576
-I never would have guessed that
in a million years.

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:45.645
-No, and sing and dance.
I mean, come on.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:47.013
What are you talking about?

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.548
But I thought it would be
kind of fun if we played a game

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:51.517
where I will say a quote from
either "A Walk to Remember"...

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:52.818
-Mm-hmm.
-...or "This Is Us."

00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:53.986
-Okay.
-And you try to guess

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:56.155
which one it's from.
But not necessarily you.

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:57.724
Just in the movie
or in the show.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.625
-Okay.
-And these are quotes from --

00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:01.594
Yeah.
-If I don't pass this quiz,

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:03.028
that doesn't really
bode well for me.

00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:04.831
It means I'm unprofessional
or something

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.365
that I don't people's lines.
-It doesn't mean that at all.

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:08.101
Either way, you win in this.
You ready?

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.302
-Okay.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:11.203
-Can I get James --
Maybe some piano music,

00:01:11.203 --> 00:01:14.373
like a romantic...
-Romantic.

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:15.374
♪♪

00:01:15.374 --> 00:01:17.910
[ Laughter ]
-I like it.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.447
-All right, ready?
-Yeah.

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:24.450
-"You have to promise
you won't fall in love with me."

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.286
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:28.721
-That's definitely
"A Walk to Remember."

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:29.822
-Yeah, it is
"A Walk to Remember"!

00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:31.591
[ Cheers and applause ]
That's right.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.859
I know you can't look at me.
-I was like, "Okay."

00:01:33.859 --> 00:01:35.962
-I love you can't even look
at my face without laughing.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:37.196
-I'll promise.
-This is who I am.

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:39.899
My romantic-comedy career
went south fast.

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:42.335
All right. Ready?

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.270
♪♪

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.273
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:49.876
"I thought
I saw something in you --

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:53.746
something good --
but I was very wrong."

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:56.048
-Oh, see, I bought that.
-You did?

00:01:56.048 --> 00:01:57.350
That was, like, really good?
That was close?

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.351
-Oof!
I felt it.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:01:59.752
-You did?
-I felt it, yeah.

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:00.887
-That's also
"A Walk to Remember."

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:02.688
-It is "A Walk to Remember"!
Very good.

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:03.722
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:05.158
You celebrate.
This one, I got you.

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:08.361
-Okay.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:09.762
-This one's a little bit
more emotional,

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:12.198
so maybe hype it up
a little bit with emotion.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:13.499
Help me out here.
Yeah, that's good.

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:16.635
♪♪

00:02:16.635 --> 00:02:19.305
"For the past 16 years,
I have put everything

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.708
and everyone ahead of myself!"

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:23.543
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:25.378
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:27.780
Come on!
You're supposed to fall for it.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.283
-That's "This Is Us."
-That is "This Is Us"!

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:32.384
There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:32.384 --> 00:02:33.486
All right.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.388
I'll do one more.
-Please, I love this.

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:36.589
-My acting's terrible.
I'll do one more.

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:38.291
-I just want an entire hour
of this.

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:40.293
-All right, here's my last one.
All right, here we go.

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:41.995
♪♪

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:46.599
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.568
First of all, that already --

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:51.304
Why would I a paw the actor?
Like...

00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:56.075
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:59.712
"I can't go back to who I was...

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:02.848
before I met you."

00:03:02.848 --> 00:03:04.317
That's it.

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:05.885
-That is Jack in "This Is Us."

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:07.653
-Yeah, it is.
I wish I was Jack.

00:03:07.653 --> 00:03:09.955
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:09.955 --> 00:03:13.893
Milo, I'm sorry!
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.761
You pulled it off.
-Nah, I didn't.

00:03:15.761 --> 00:03:18.131
He's so --
You guys are so good.

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:20.299
But can we say
what happens in the season?

00:03:20.299 --> 00:03:23.570
We show, like, the beginning
of your relationship.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:25.838
-Yes.
The Jack and Rebecca courtship

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:27.140
